      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Automatic colorization of a grayscale image using the colorization_deploy_v2 ONNX model (Zhang et al., ECCV 2016).\n\nPipeline:\n  LoadImage (grayscale) -> CV Colorize Model (L-channel -> predict ab -> Lab -> BGR)\n  -> PreviewImage\n\nModel: colorization_deploy_v2_2026april.onnx in ComfyUI/models/onnx\nSource: https://huggingface.co/opencv/opencv_contribution/tree/main/submissions/colorization\n\nThe model takes the L channel of a LAB image, predicts the ab colour channels, and merges them back with the original L to produce a full-colour output. The 'strength' slider scales the predicted ab channels (0 = grayscale passthrough, 1 = original model output, >1 = oversaturated colours)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
